# KSChat 💬

KSChat is a real-time full-stack chatroom application built using **Node.js**, **Express.js**, **Microsoft SQL Server**, and **Socket.IO**. It allows users to create and join public chatrooms, exchange messages in real time, reply to and edit messages, and manage chatroom membership through a modern web interface.

---

## Features

-  User Registration and Login
-  Real-time messaging using Socket.IO
-  Create and browse public chatrooms
-  Join and leave chatrooms
-  Edit messages
-  Delete messages
-  Reply to messages
-  View room members
-  Chatroom expiration based on configurable lifetime
-  Automatic database initialization on first launch
-  Public access using Cloudflare Tunnel (optional)

---

